#: modinfo.json
msgid "Tactical NPC AI"
msgstr "战术 NPC AI"

#: modinfo.json
msgid "Adds tactical follower regrouping and the Maid's Promise start with a female NPC companion."
msgstr "加入战术追随者重组功能，以及带有女性 NPC 同伴的“女仆的承诺”开局。"

#: npcs.json
msgid "Maid"
msgstr "女仆"

#: npcs.json
msgid "I served a household before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "灾变前我曾在一个家庭中服侍。"

#: traits.json
msgid "Maid companion marker"
msgstr "女仆同伴标记"

#: traits.json
msgid "Internal marker for the Tactical NPC AI maid companion."
msgstr "战术 NPC AI 女仆同伴使用的内部标记。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "Good day. I served in a household before the Cataclysm. I shall remain at your side and assist you to the best of my ability."
msgstr "日安。我在灾变前曾侍奉一个家庭。我会留在您身边，尽我所能协助您。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "What duties can you perform?"
msgstr "您能做些什么？"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "Are you all right?"
msgstr "您还好吗？"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "Please stay close to me."
msgstr "请跟紧我。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "Let us continue."
msgstr "我们继续吧。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "I am capable of preparing meals, tending to minor wounds, maintaining our supplies, and carrying out practical tasks. Please give me your instructions, and I shall do my utmost to fulfill them."
msgstr "我能够准备食物、处理轻伤、维护物资并完成实用任务。请下达指示，我会尽最大努力完成。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "谢谢。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "I confess that these circumstances are unsettling. Nevertheless, I shall remain close to you and follow your instructions. You need not be concerned on my account."
msgstr "我承认这些处境令人不安。不过，我会留在您身边并听从您的指示。您无需担心我。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "Very well. Stay with me."
msgstr "很好。跟紧我。"

#: dialogue.json
msgid "We will manage this together."
msgstr "我们会一起渡过难关。"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Survivor with a Maid"
msgstr "与女仆同行的幸存者"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Survivor with a Maid"
msgstr "与女仆同行的幸存者"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You survived the Cataclysm with a household maid who refused to leave you behind."
msgstr "你和一名不愿丢下你的女仆一起在灾变中活了下来。"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You survived the Cataclysm with a household maid who refused to leave you behind."
msgstr "你和一名不愿丢下你的女仆一起在灾变中活了下来。"

#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Maid's Promise"
msgstr "女仆的承诺"

#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Maid's Promise"
msgstr "女仆的承诺"

#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You survived the first days of the Cataclysm with a capable maid who chose to stay by your side."
msgstr "你和一名有能力的女仆一起熬过了灾变最初的日子，她选择留在你身边。"

#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You survived the first days of the Cataclysm with a capable maid who chose to stay by your side."
msgstr "你和一名有能力的女仆一起熬过了灾变最初的日子，她选择留在你身边。"

#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Evac Shelter"
msgstr "疏散避难所"
